        "original_id": "b0996c9e-f6f5-5894-b983-a74a07589073",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: SLS station, Sahara station, Las Vegas Strip, Winchester, Nevada\n- Projects: Las Vegas Monorail downtown extension\n- Companies: Circus Circus Las Vegas, Riviera\n\nFacts:\n- The tracks just north of Sahara station were designed to provide access to a possible downtown extension of the Las Vegas Monorail via the northern portion of the Las Vegas Strip.\n- The possible downtown extension of the Las Vegas Monorail would run in the area of Circus Circus Las Vegas and the Riviera.\n- Circus Circus Las Vegas is a hotel, a 123,928-square-foot casino, and an RV park on the Las Vegas Strip in Winchester, Nevada.",
